Third-party material
--------------------

The licence above covers only the author's original work. The following
material remains with its owners and is used under their terms:

- Figures transcribed from the annual reports of the Department of Wildlife
  and National Parks Peninsular Malaysia (PERHILITAN) and the Bornean Sun Bear
  Conservation Centre (BSBCC). Used with the permission of each organisation.
  Reuse of these figures requires the permission of the respective owner.

